| mtLoRA | L3RSb9yTlL.md | 5.50 | Same topic (multi-task LoRA), incremental novelty, comprehensive experiments, accepted as poster. This paper has a cleaner narrative but the theoretical conflation is a real issue. Roughly comparable. |
| QuestA | 3MifB0f7qR.md | 6.00 | Clean method with strong empirical results but unnecessary/confusing theoretical section. Very similar profile—accepted as poster. This paper is comparable. |
| IBNorm | Bzbu5czqMY.md | 4.00 | Strong empirical results but fundamentally invalid theoretical proofs (misapplied theorems). This paper's theoretical issue is less severe—sloppy notation rather than invalid proofs. Clearly above this. |
| ALoRA | noNpK9Vt8l.md | 3.50 | Challenges same A-matrix assumption, limited model scale, weak baselines. This paper is clearly stronger—more comprehensive experiments and a cleaner method. |
