**Section 4 (Multi-Sample Methods):** Table 2 reviews three existing methods. The brief mention of four-category annotation grouping is the only content that connects to MOCHA, but it is deferred to supplementary material. The paper effectively ends here with no results, no experiments, no software documentation.

## Strengths

