|-------|------|-----------|------------|
| Embodied-IQA | azj53PLJRL.md | 7.00 | New IQA task with 30k+ image pairs, thorough validation. Grounding-IQA has similar task novelty but much smaller scale and less validation. Below this. |
| ImageDoctor | 04HwYGgp2w.md | 6.50 | Spatial grounding + quality assessment, pixel-level heatmaps. More complex methodology and downstream application (reward model). Grounding-IQA is less ambitious but more focused. Slightly below this. |
