|-------|-----------|----------|------------|
| RO-HNN: Symplectic autoencoder for Hamiltonian dynamics (JfNkiril3c) | 4.0 | Reject | Very similar domain and contribution level. Combines existing components (symplectic autoencoder + HNN), rejected for limited novelty and missing baselines. Our paper has similar novelty but better empirical evidence (Table 2). |
| SPS-GAN: Symplectic Phase Space GAN (VoMQN1GDB2) | 4.0 | Reject | Similar domain (Hamiltonian structure preservation), rejected for insufficient experiments and no ablation. Our paper has stronger experiments but similar issues with missing baselines. |
